        <obo1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A relation between a data item and a quality of a material entity where the material entity is the specified output of a material transformation which achieves an objective specification that indicates the intended value of the specified quality.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <obo1:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">Person:Alan Ruttenberg</obo1:IAO_0000117>
