        <obo1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A localized irrigation process in which water is conveyed under pressure through a buried pipe system where it drips slowly below the soil surface close to plants&apos; roots.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:creator xml:lang="en">https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6284-4821</dc:creator>
