        <obo1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An implement that uses a combination of air and liquid to deliver liquid material to the target. It includes include nozzles that deliver spray droplets directly into a high-speed airstream. The air blast shatters the drops of liquid material into fine droplets and transports them to the target.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
