        <obo1:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">a sphere-shaped region of space,</obo1:IAO_0000112>
        <obo1:IAO_0000600 xml:lang="en">A three-dimensional spatial region is a spatial region that is of three dimensions. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [040-001])</obo1:IAO_0000600>
        <obo1:IAO_0000602>(forall (x) (if (ThreeDimensionalSpatialRegion x) (SpatialRegion x))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [040-001] </obo1:IAO_0000602>
