        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A compound or agent that combines with an enzyme in such a manner as to prevent the normal substrate-enzyme combination and the catalytic reaction.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
