        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A food preservative that acts by chelating with metal cations (particularly those of copper, iron and nickel) that catalyse the oxidation of fats in food.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
