        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any compound that is added to manufactured materials to inhibit, suppress, or delay the production of flames and so prevent the spread of fire.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
