        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A depression which has been formed as a result of erosion by water or ice and which is low-lying, bordered by higher ground, and especially elongate.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
