        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An extent or area of land where surface water from rain and melting snow or ice converges to a single point at lower elevation, usually the exit of the basin, where the waters join another waterbody.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
