        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The mixture of gases (roughly (by molar content/volume: 78% nitrogen, 20.95% oxygen, 0.93% argon, 0.038% carbon dioxide, trace amounts of other gases, and a variable amount (average around 1%) of water vapor) that surrounds the planet Earth.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
