            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo1:IAO_0000115>A dome swamp is a swamp which occurs in a depression where deeper waters at the centre of the swamp allow  trees to grow taller relative to those in shallower regions of the depression. This creates a dome-like shape.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
