        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An tundra climatic condition is a polar condition in which at least one month&apos;s average temperature exceeds 0 degrees Celsius.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
