        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Biological waste is waste containing mostly natural organic materials (remains of plants, animal excrement, biological sludge from waste-water treatment plants and so forth).</obo1:IAO_0000115>
