        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A boundary wall is a constructed barrier which is usually opaque, constructed from masonry, and of greater structural strength than a fence.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
