            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo1:IAO_0000115>A planetary mantle is a planetary layer which is an interior part of a terrestrial planet or other rocky body large enough to have differentiation by density.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
