        <obo1:IAO_0000115>Magma is a mixture of molten or semi-molten rock, volatiles, and solids that is found beneath the uppermost solid layer of a planetary body. Besides molten rock, magma may also contain suspended crystals, dissolved gas and sometimes gas bubbles.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">magma</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
