        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>A mass gaseous flow which occurrs in a planet&apos;s atmosphere due to internal pressure disequilibria.</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">atmospheric wind</rdfs:label>
