        <obo1:IAO_0000115>An anthropisation process during which terrestrial environments - natural or anthropised - or parts thereof are altered to facilitate human activities such as agriculture, settlement, or commerce.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>land conversion</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>land development</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
