        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Any process that mediates interactions between a cell and its surroundings. Encompasses interactions such as signaling or attachment between one cell and another cell, between a cell and an extracellular matrix, or between a cell and any other aspect of its environment.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GOC:mah</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
