        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo1:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">author information section</obo1:IAO_0000111>
        <obo1:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">The section labelled &apos;author information&apos; in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. in Takon. Ann Gen Psychiatry. 2011; 10: 25. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3204268/)</obo1:IAO_0000112>
        <obo1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A part of a document about the authors that provides biographical information and may discuss how the authors&apos; professional experiences are relevant to the work described in the document.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
