        <obo1:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">The section labelled &apos;notes&apos; in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. McLean et al. Br J Gen Pract. 2014 Jul; 64(624): e440–e447 (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4073730/):</obo1:IAO_0000112>
        <obo1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A part of a document containing typically short notes about the document itself and/or the authors. Often the notes section contains subsections related to funding, competing interests, ethical approval, etc.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
