        <obo1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">is a process with the objective to place a material entity bearing the &apos;material to be added role&apos; into a material bearing the &apos;target of material addition role&apos;.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">adding a material entity into a target</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


