        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A structure quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s disposition to admit the passage of gas or liquid through pores or interstices.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
