        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A physical quality of a liquid inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s disposition to internal resistance to flow.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">viscosity</rdfs:label>
