        <obo1:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A process quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s magnitude of the temporal extent between the starting and ending point.</obo1:IAO_0000115>
