        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A multi-tissue plant structure (PO:0025496) that develops from a gynoecium (PO:0009062), or a single carpel (PO:0009030), and at maturity may have as parts one or more seeds (PO:0009010).</owl:annotatedTarget>
